{
  "description": "ConfigService (plan §11.1, §15.1, §15.7, §23, §24), on the engine executor, with ProblemService. load(): the version is the kv value config.version (0 when there is none); a missing config.json gives the defaults (decode of {\"version\": 3}) and writes nothing; a file that decodes and validates without errors (warnings are fine) is the configuration, and is kept in kv as config.lastGood; a file that doesn't (not JSON, or any error issue) leaves the file alone, uses config.lastGood (the defaults when there is none) and raises config.invalid{count} (error, action openSettings), count being the number of errors. update(doc, version): config.versionConflict{current} unless version is the current one, and also while another update is saving; config.rejected{count (of errors), issues (all of them)} when the document has errors (secrets written into it are config.secretInline errors), nothing saved; otherwise kv config.version = version + 1 first, then kv config.lastGood, then config.json (canonical, mode 0600, written atomically), so a crash or a failed write can only make a client reload, never let an old version through; config.invalid is cleared, configChanged{version} published, and the result is the envelope. A write that fails is config.saveFailed{reason: the failure's code}: the version (and config.lastGood, when it got that far) have moved on, the file and the configuration in use haven't. validate(doc): the issues, nothing saved. envelope(): {version, doc, issues (the current document's), secrets: every SecretRef name the document uses, in document order, with set = the keystore has it or BROMELIA_SECRET_<NAME> is given (a keystore failure counts as not set)}. secret(name) (not on the executor): the keystore's value, else the environment's BROMELIA_SECRET_<NAME> (upper case, '.' → '_'; an empty value counts as none), else null; when the keystore fails and the environment has nothing, its failure. setSecret(name, value): stores it in the keystore ('' removes it) and publishes configChanged{version} (the version doesn't change); a keystore failure is returned. export(): the export bundle (ConfigCodec.exportBundle). Given: file (config.json: a document, or {text} for raw text; absent: no file); kv {key: value}; keystore {name: value}; keystoreFails {name: {code, params}} (every keystore call for that name fails so); environment {BROMELIA_SECRET_<NAME>: value} (what the composition root passes); writeFails {code, params} (every config.json write fails so); holdWrites (every write, to the kv table or config.json, waits for a releaseWrites op). ops in order: load, {update: {doc, version, wait (default true; false: start it and go on, its result comes when it finishes)}}, {validate: doc}, envelope, {secret: name}, {setSecret: {name, value}}, export, current, version, releaseWrites (lets the held writes go and waits for the ops they held). Expect: results (one per op except releaseWrites, in op order: ok for load and setSecret, the envelope for update and envelope, issues for validate, the value (or null) for secret, the bundle for export, the document for current, the number for version; {error: {code, params}} for a failure); file (config.json afterwards: a document, {text}, or null for none; when written, its mode is 0600); kv, keystore (everything afterwards); events; problems. Every configuration document in expect (an envelope's doc, current, file, kv config.lastGood, export's config) is compared after ConfigCodec.decode, so it is written as short as the given ones.",
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "a-missing-file-gives-the-defaults",
      "given": { "ops": ["load", "version", "current", "envelope"] },
      "expect": {
        "results": ["ok", 0, { "version": 3 }, { "version": 0, "doc": { "version": 3 }, "issues": [], "secrets": [] }],
        "file": null, "kv": {}, "keystore": {}, "events": [], "problems": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "load-reads-the-file-and-the-version",
      "given": {
        "file": { "version": 3, "metadata": { "provider": "tmdb" } },
        "kv": { "config.version": 7 },
        "ops": ["load", "version", "current"]
      },
      "expect": {
        "results": ["ok", 7, { "version": 3, "metadata": { "provider": "tmdb" } }],
        "file": { "version": 3, "metadata": { "provider": "tmdb" } },
        "kv": { "config.version": 7, "config.lastGood": { "version": 3, "metadata": { "provider": "tmdb" } } },
        "keystore": {}, "events": [], "problems": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "an-invalid-file-keeps-the-last-good-one",
      "given": {
        "file": { "version": 3, "defaultProfile": "nope", "metadata": { "provider": "omdb" } },
        "kv": { "config.version": 4, "config.lastGood": { "version": 3, "metadata": { "provider": "tmdb" } } },
        "ops": ["load", "version", "current"]
      },
      "expect": {
        "results": ["ok", 4, { "version": 3, "metadata": { "provider": "tmdb" } }],
        "file": { "version": 3, "defaultProfile": "nope", "metadata": { "provider": "omdb" } },
        "kv": { "config.version": 4, "config.lastGood": { "version": 3, "metadata": { "provider": "tmdb" } } },
        "keystore": {},
        "events": [
          { "seq": 1, "at": "2026-10-02T20:00:00.000Z", "type": "problemRaised", "data": { "problem":
            { "id": "config.invalid", "code": "config.invalid", "params": { "count": 1 }, "severity": "error", "raisedAt": "2026-10-02T20:00:00.000Z",
              "actions": ["openSettings"] } } }
        ],
        "problems": [
          { "id": "config.invalid", "code": "config.invalid", "params": { "count": 1 }, "severity": "error", "raisedAt": "2026-10-02T20:00:00.000Z",
            "actions": ["openSettings"] }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a-file-that-isnt-json-and-no-last-good-one-gives-the-defaults",
      "given": {
        "file": { "text": "{ \"version\": 3," },
        "ops": ["load", "current"]
      },
      "expect": {
        "results": ["ok", { "version": 3 }],
        "file": { "text": "{ \"version\": 3," },
        "kv": {}, "keystore": {},
        "events": [
          { "seq": 1, "at": "2026-10-02T20:00:00.000Z", "type": "problemRaised", "data": { "problem":
            { "id": "config.invalid", "code": "config.invalid", "params": { "count": 1 }, "severity": "error", "raisedAt": "2026-10-02T20:00:00.000Z",
              "actions": ["openSettings"] } } }
        ],
        "problems": [
          { "id": "config.invalid", "code": "config.invalid", "params": { "count": 1 }, "severity": "error", "raisedAt": "2026-10-02T20:00:00.000Z",
            "actions": ["openSettings"] }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "warnings-dont-make-a-file-invalid",
      "given": {
        "file": { "version": 3, "colour": "red" },
        "ops": ["load", "envelope"]
      },
      "expect": {
        "results": ["ok", { "version": 0, "doc": { "version": 3 },
                            "issues": [{ "path": "colour", "code": "config.unknownKey", "severity": "warning" }], "secrets": [] }],
        "file": { "version": 3, "colour": "red" },
        "kv": { "config.lastGood": { "version": 3 } },
        "keystore": {}, "events": [], "problems": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "update-saves-and-publishes",
      "given": {
        "ops": ["load", { "update": { "doc": { "version": 3, "metadata": { "provider": "tmdb" } }, "version": 0 } }, "version"]
      },
      "expect": {
        "results": ["ok", { "version": 1, "doc": { "version": 3, "metadata": { "provider": "tmdb" } }, "issues": [], "secrets": [] }, 1],
        "file": { "version": 3, "metadata": { "provider": "tmdb" } },
        "kv": { "config.version": 1, "config.lastGood": { "version": 3, "metadata": { "provider": "tmdb" } } },
        "keystore": {},
        "events": [{ "seq": 1, "at": "2026-10-02T20:00:00.000Z", "type": "configChanged", "data": { "version": 1 } }],
        "problems": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "an-old-version-is-a-conflict",
      "given": {
        "file": { "version": 3 },
        "kv": { "config.version": 3 },
        "ops": ["load", { "update": { "doc": { "version": 3, "metadata": { "provider": "tmdb" } }, "version": 2 } }]
      },
      "expect": {
        "results": ["ok", { "error": { "code": "config.versionConflict", "params": { "current": 3 } } }],
        "file": { "version": 3 },
        "kv": { "config.version": 3, "config.lastGood": { "version": 3 } },
        "keystore": {}, "events": [], "problems": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a-document-with-errors-is-rejected",
      "given": {
        "ops": ["load", { "update": { "doc": { "version": 3, "defaultProfile": "nope" }, "version": 0 } }, "version"]
      },
      "expect": {
        "results": ["ok",
          { "error": { "code": "config.rejected", "params": { "count": 1, "issues": [
            { "path": "defaultProfile", "code": "config.unknownReference", "params": { "kind": "profile", "id": "nope" }, "severity": "error" }] } } },
          0],
        "file": null, "kv": {}, "keystore": {}, "events": [], "problems": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a-secret-in-the-document-is-rejected",
      "given": {
        "ops": ["load", { "update": { "doc": { "version": 3, "metadata": { "provider": "tmdb", "apiKey": "0123456789abcdef" } }, "version": 0 } }]
      },
      "expect": {
        "results": ["ok",
          { "error": { "code": "config.rejected", "params": { "count": 1, "issues": [
            { "path": "metadata.apiKey", "code": "config.secretInline", "severity": "error" }] } } }],
        "file": null, "kv": {}, "keystore": {}, "events": [], "problems": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "saving-a-good-one-clears-config-invalid",
      "given": {
        "file": { "text": "nonsense" },
        "kv": { "config.version": 2, "config.lastGood": { "version": 3, "metadata": { "provider": "tmdb" } } },
        "ops": ["load", { "update": { "doc": { "version": 3, "metadata": { "provider": "omdb" } }, "version": 2 } }]
      },
      "expect": {
        "results": ["ok", { "version": 3, "doc": { "version": 3, "metadata": { "provider": "omdb" } }, "issues": [], "secrets": [] }],
        "file": { "version": 3, "metadata": { "provider": "omdb" } },
        "kv": { "config.version": 3, "config.lastGood": { "version": 3, "metadata": { "provider": "omdb" } } },
        "keystore": {},
        "events": [
          { "seq": 1, "at": "2026-10-02T20:00:00.000Z", "type": "problemRaised", "data": { "problem":
            { "id": "config.invalid", "code": "config.invalid", "params": { "count": 1 }, "severity": "error", "raisedAt": "2026-10-02T20:00:00.000Z",
              "actions": ["openSettings"] } } },
          { "seq": 2, "at": "2026-10-02T20:00:00.000Z", "type": "problemCleared", "data": { "problemId": "config.invalid", "code": "config.invalid" } },
          { "seq": 3, "at": "2026-10-02T20:00:00.000Z", "type": "configChanged", "data": { "version": 3 } }
        ],
        "problems": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a-write-that-fails-leaves-the-configuration-alone",
      "given": {
        "file": { "version": 3 },
        "writeFails": { "code": "fs.failed", "params": { "path": "config.json", "reason": "No space left on device" } },
        "ops": ["load",
          { "update": { "doc": { "version": 3, "metadata": { "provider": "tmdb" } }, "version": 0 } },
          "version", "current",
          { "update": { "doc": { "version": 3, "metadata": { "provider": "tmdb" } }, "version": 0 } }]
      },
      "expect": {
        "results": ["ok",
          { "error": { "code": "config.saveFailed", "params": { "reason": "fs.failed" } } },
          1, { "version": 3 },
          { "error": { "code": "config.versionConflict", "params": { "current": 1 } } }],
        "file": { "version": 3 },
        "kv": { "config.version": 1, "config.lastGood": { "version": 3, "metadata": { "provider": "tmdb" } } },
        "keystore": {}, "events": [], "problems": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "an-update-while-another-saves-is-a-conflict",
      "given": {
        "holdWrites": true,
        "ops": ["load",
          { "update": { "doc": { "version": 3, "metadata": { "provider": "tmdb" } }, "version": 0, "wait": false } },
          { "update": { "doc": { "version": 3, "metadata": { "provider": "omdb" } }, "version": 0 } },
          "releaseWrites",
          "version"]
      },
      "expect": {
        "results": ["ok",
          { "version": 1, "doc": { "version": 3, "metadata": { "provider": "tmdb" } }, "issues": [], "secrets": [] },
          { "error": { "code": "config.versionConflict", "params": { "current": 0 } } },
          1],
        "file": { "version": 3, "metadata": { "provider": "tmdb" } },
        "kv": { "config.version": 1, "config.lastGood": { "version": 3, "metadata": { "provider": "tmdb" } } },
        "keystore": {},
        "events": [{ "seq": 1, "at": "2026-10-02T20:00:00.000Z", "type": "configChanged", "data": { "version": 1 } }],
        "problems": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "validate-only-reports",
      "given": {
        "ops": ["load",
          { "validate": { "version": 3, "defaultProfile": "nope", "colour": "red" } },
          { "validate": { "version": 3 } }]
      },
      "expect": {
        "results": ["ok",
          [{ "path": "colour", "code": "config.unknownKey", "severity": "warning" },
           { "path": "defaultProfile", "code": "config.unknownReference", "params": { "kind": "profile", "id": "nope" }, "severity": "error" }],
          []],
        "file": null, "kv": {}, "keystore": {}, "events": [], "problems": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-envelope-lists-the-secrets-without-values",
      "given": {
        "file": { "version": 3,
                  "makemkv": { "registrationKey": { "secret": "makemkv.key" } },
                  "metadata": { "provider": "tmdb", "apiKey": { "secret": "metadata.tmdb" } },
                  "notifications": { "targets": [
                    { "id": "phone", "url": { "secret": "notify.phone" } },
                    { "id": "phone2", "url": { "secret": "makemkv.key" } }] } },
        "keystore": { "makemkv.key": "T-0123456789" },
        "environment": { "BROMELIA_SECRET_METADATA_TMDB": "abcdef" },
        "ops": ["load", "envelope"]
      },
      "expect": {
        "results": ["ok", {
          "version": 0,
          "doc": { "version": 3,
                   "makemkv": { "registrationKey": { "secret": "makemkv.key" } },
                   "metadata": { "provider": "tmdb", "apiKey": { "secret": "metadata.tmdb" } },
                   "notifications": { "targets": [
                     { "id": "phone", "url": { "secret": "notify.phone" } },
                     { "id": "phone2", "url": { "secret": "makemkv.key" } }] } },
          "issues": [],
          "secrets": [{ "name": "makemkv.key", "set": true }, { "name": "metadata.tmdb", "set": true }, { "name": "notify.phone", "set": false }] }],
        "file": { "version": 3,
                  "makemkv": { "registrationKey": { "secret": "makemkv.key" } },
                  "metadata": { "provider": "tmdb", "apiKey": { "secret": "metadata.tmdb" } },
                  "notifications": { "targets": [
                    { "id": "phone", "url": { "secret": "notify.phone" } },
                    { "id": "phone2", "url": { "secret": "makemkv.key" } }] } },
        "kv": { "config.lastGood": { "version": 3,
                  "makemkv": { "registrationKey": { "secret": "makemkv.key" } },
                  "metadata": { "provider": "tmdb", "apiKey": { "secret": "metadata.tmdb" } },
                  "notifications": { "targets": [
                    { "id": "phone", "url": { "secret": "notify.phone" } },
                    { "id": "phone2", "url": { "secret": "makemkv.key" } }] } } },
        "keystore": { "makemkv.key": "T-0123456789" },
        "events": [], "problems": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "secrets-come-from-the-keystore-then-the-environment",
      "given": {
        "keystore": { "makemkv.key": "from-keystore" },
        "environment": { "BROMELIA_SECRET_MAKEMKV_KEY": "from-env", "BROMELIA_SECRET_METADATA_TMDB": "env-only",
                         "BROMELIA_SECRET_NOTIFY_HOME-1": "dash" },
        "ops": ["load", { "secret": "makemkv.key" }, { "secret": "metadata.tmdb" }, { "secret": "notify.home-1" }, { "secret": "notify.phone" }]
      },
      "expect": {
        "results": ["ok", "from-keystore", "env-only", "dash", null],
        "file": null, "kv": {}, "keystore": { "makemkv.key": "from-keystore" }, "events": [], "problems": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a-keystore-that-fails-falls-back-to-the-environment",
      "given": {
        "file": { "version": 3,
                  "makemkv": { "registrationKey": { "secret": "makemkv.key" } },
                  "metadata": { "provider": "tmdb", "apiKey": { "secret": "metadata.tmdb" } } },
        "keystoreFails": {
          "makemkv.key": { "code": "fs.notPrivate", "params": { "path": "/Volumes/nas/Bromelia/secrets", "reason": "a network share" } },
          "metadata.tmdb": { "code": "fs.notPrivate", "params": { "path": "/Volumes/nas/Bromelia/secrets", "reason": "a network share" } } },
        "environment": { "BROMELIA_SECRET_METADATA_TMDB": "abcdef" },
        "ops": ["load", { "secret": "metadata.tmdb" }, { "secret": "makemkv.key" }, "envelope"]
      },
      "expect": {
        "results": ["ok", "abcdef",
          { "error": { "code": "fs.notPrivate", "params": { "path": "/Volumes/nas/Bromelia/secrets", "reason": "a network share" } } },
          { "version": 0,
            "doc": { "version": 3,
                     "makemkv": { "registrationKey": { "secret": "makemkv.key" } },
                     "metadata": { "provider": "tmdb", "apiKey": { "secret": "metadata.tmdb" } } },
            "issues": [],
            "secrets": [{ "name": "makemkv.key", "set": false }, { "name": "metadata.tmdb", "set": true }] }],
        "file": { "version": 3,
                  "makemkv": { "registrationKey": { "secret": "makemkv.key" } },
                  "metadata": { "provider": "tmdb", "apiKey": { "secret": "metadata.tmdb" } } },
        "kv": { "config.lastGood": { "version": 3,
                  "makemkv": { "registrationKey": { "secret": "makemkv.key" } },
                  "metadata": { "provider": "tmdb", "apiKey": { "secret": "metadata.tmdb" } } } },
        "keystore": {}, "events": [], "problems": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "set-secret-stores-removes-and-publishes",
      "given": {
        "kv": { "config.version": 5 },
        "keystore": { "metadata.tmdb": "old" },
        "ops": ["load", { "setSecret": { "name": "makemkv.key", "value": "T-0123456789" } }, { "setSecret": { "name": "metadata.tmdb", "value": "" } },
                "version", { "secret": "makemkv.key" }, { "secret": "metadata.tmdb" }]
      },
      "expect": {
        "results": ["ok", "ok", "ok", 5, "T-0123456789", null],
        "file": null, "kv": { "config.version": 5 },
        "keystore": { "makemkv.key": "T-0123456789" },
        "events": [
          { "seq": 1, "at": "2026-10-02T20:00:00.000Z", "type": "configChanged", "data": { "version": 5 } },
          { "seq": 2, "at": "2026-10-02T20:00:00.000Z", "type": "configChanged", "data": { "version": 5 } }
        ],
        "problems": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "set-secret-reports-a-keystore-failure",
      "given": {
        "keystoreFails": { "makemkv.key": { "code": "keystore.failed", "params": { "name": "makemkv.key", "reason": "The keychain is locked" } } },
        "ops": ["load", { "setSecret": { "name": "makemkv.key", "value": "T-0123456789" } }]
      },
      "expect": {
        "results": ["ok", { "error": { "code": "keystore.failed", "params": { "name": "makemkv.key", "reason": "The keychain is locked" } } }],
        "file": null, "kv": {}, "keystore": {}, "events": [], "problems": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "export-keeps-references-not-values",
      "given": {
        "file": { "version": 3, "metadata": { "provider": "tmdb", "apiKey": { "secret": "metadata.tmdb" } } },
        "keystore": { "metadata.tmdb": "abcdef" },
        "ops": ["load", "export"]
      },
      "expect": {
        "results": ["ok", { "format": "bromelia-config", "version": 3,
                            "config": { "version": 3, "metadata": { "provider": "tmdb", "apiKey": { "secret": "metadata.tmdb" } } } }],
        "file": { "version": 3, "metadata": { "provider": "tmdb", "apiKey": { "secret": "metadata.tmdb" } } },
        "kv": { "config.lastGood": { "version": 3, "metadata": { "provider": "tmdb", "apiKey": { "secret": "metadata.tmdb" } } } },
        "keystore": { "metadata.tmdb": "abcdef" }, "events": [], "problems": []
      }
    }
  ]
}
